  "notes": "ETYMOLOGY:\n{配|はい} (distribute, arrange) + {慮|りょ} (consideration, thought)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜に{配慮|はいりょ}する - to be considerate of ~\n- 〜への{配慮|はいりょ} - consideration for ~\n- ご{配慮|はいりょ} - (your) consideration (honorific)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {環境|かんきょう}への{配慮|はいりょ} - environmental consideration\n- {安全|あんぜん}への{配慮|はいりょ} - safety considerations\n- {配慮|はいりょ}に{欠|か}ける - to lack consideration\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {思|おも}いやり - compassion, thoughtfulness\n- {気遣|きづか}い - concern, solicitude\n- {心遣|こころづか}い - thoughtfulness",
